comments.body:
Thanks @johnfunmula , I just tried reproducing this again and couldn't.  

I think what could have happened and what I can reproduce is that I copied the json without the "mcpServers" key.  So something like 

```json
{
  "fetch": {
    "command": "uvx",
    "args": [
      "mcp-server-fetch",
      "--ignore-robots-txt"
    ],
    "enabled": true,
    "disabled": true,
    "alwaysAllow": []
  }
}
```

Instead of

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "fetch": {
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": [
        "mcp-server-fetch",
        "--ignore-robots-txt"
      ],
      "enabled": true,
      "disabled": true,
      "alwaysAllow": []
    }
  }
}
```

When I click save without the mcpServers key (or probably any invalid json), there's no feedback or error message.
